; Doc 01 §10 places this file; §5.2 specifies its contents as a `_draw()` node.
; There is deliberately nothing in this scene but the root: every circle is
; drawn from `Eyes.geometry(head_diameter)` at draw time, so an eye pair is
; correct at any head size without a single authored number. §9.3: "Eyes are
; procedural. Do not supply eye PNGs."

